@item @kbd{w} (@code{vellumory-fit-width})
@itemx @kbd{W}
@kindex w
@kindex W
@findex vellumory-fit-width
Fit the page to the window's width.
@item @kbd{0} (@code{vellumory-recenter})
@kindex 0
@findex vellumory-recenter
Switch between the page fitted to the
  window's width and the zoom you were reading at.  From a zoomed or
  sideways-scrolled view@comma{} @code{0} fits the page and remembers your zoom and
  scroll; pressed again@comma{} it returns to them.  The spot in the middle of the
  window stays in place either way.
@item @kbd{P} (@code{vellumory-fit-page})
@itemx @kbd{H}
@kindex P
@kindex H
