@section Contents and headings

@cindex outline
@cindex contents
@cindex table of contents
@cindex imenu
@findex vellumory-outline-mode

@table @asis
@item @kbd{o} (@code{vellumory-outline})
@kindex o
@findex vellumory-outline
Show or hide the document's contents (its
  outline) in a sidebar.
@item @kbd{i} (@code{vellumory-goto-heading})
@kindex i
