@node What annotations cannot do yet
@section What annotations cannot do yet

@cindex annotations, limits

The kinds are highlight@comma{} underline@comma{} strike-out@comma{} squiggly underline and
text notes.  There is no free-hand drawing@comma{} there are no shapes@comma{} and
annotations cannot be moved or resized; editing changes their text only.

Annotations respect the archival standard PDF/A: they are marked as
printable@comma{} as PDF/A requires.  Highlights need transparency@comma{} which PDF/A-1
forbids@comma{} so in a PDF/A-1 document Vellumory refuses to highlight and
suggests an underline instead.

